s individuals; -Excellent verbal and written communication skills required; -Ability to work well in a small team environment; -Knowledge of engineering and the ability to close solicitations; -Must be willing to travel and work irregular hours as needed. Understanding and commitment to Kettering University Values a. RESPECT : for teamwork, honesty, encouragement, diversity partnerships with students. b. INTEGRITY : including accountability, transparency and ethics. c. CREATIVITY : fostering flexibility and innovation. d. COLLABORATION : across disciplines and with all partners. e. EXCELLENCE : in all we do. Special Event Expectations: Participation and assistance is expected at major campus special events, such as commencement. Posting Information Posting Number SP00491 Posting Date 09/14/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Job Duties Job Duties Percent of total time 85 Duties Oversee a portfolio of existing individual donors and identify new prospective donors to cultivate, solicit, and steward. Cultivate existing individual donors and encourage renewal and increased donor support. Collaborate with other staff on rating, solicitation and stewardship strategies. Percent of total time 10 Duties Participate in planning and staffing fundraising and friend-raising events. Percent of total time 5 Duties Support the overall work of the University Advancement office including Alumni Engagement, Special Events, Corporate and Foundation Giving, and External Relations. Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Please provide the specific name of the publication or website where you learned about this posting. (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter List of References Optional Documents Kettering University, 1700 University Ave. Flint, MI 48504 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
