      "title": "Lifeguard",
      "description": "Kettering University Employment Opportunities | Lifeguard Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Lifeguard Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Job Title Lifeguard Position Class Type Casual Position Type Casual Other Position Information Kettering University is seeking to immediately fill a part-time Lifeguard position. The selected candidate must have current lifeguard certification from the Red Cross or Ellis. Position Status Part-time If Part Time, hours per week 20 Posting Text Preferred Qualifications Ability to work flexible hours/multiple shifts Job Specific Required Qualifications Current Red Cross or Ellis Lifeguard certification required. Must be available to work during critical hours between 10:30am – 1:30pm Monday through Friday. Understanding and commitment to Kettering University Values a. RESPECT : for teamwork, honesty, encouragement, diversity partnerships with students. b. INTEGRITY : including accountability, transparency and ethics. c. CREATIVITY : fostering flexibility and innovation. d. COLLABORATION : across disciplines and with all partners. e. EXCELLENCE : in all we do. Posting Information Posting Number CP00008 Posting Date 01/14/2020 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Job Duties Job Duties Percent of total time 100 Duties 1. Maintains constant surveillance of patrons in the facility; acts immediately and appropriately to secure safety of patrons in the event of emergency. 2. Provides emergency care and treatment as required until the arrival of emergency medical services. 3. Presents professional appearance and attitude at all times, and maintains a high standard of customer service. 4. Performs miscellaneous job-related duties as assigned. Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Do you have current Red Cross or Ellis Lifeguard certification? Yes No * Please provide the specific name of the publication or website where you learned about this posting. (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume List of References Optional Documents Cover Letter Kettering University, 1700 University Ave. Flint, MI 48504 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
